    "theorem": "VeluFrobeniusAudit.velu_frobenius_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem velu_frobenius_certificate : (Nat.Prime 3 ∧ Nat.Coprime 3 5 ∧ baseCurve.Δ ≠ 0) ∧ (∀ (G : Type) [AddCommGroup G] (F : G →+ G) (P : G), (∀ Q ∈ AddSubgroup.zmultiples P, F Q ∈ AddSubgroup.zmultiples P) ↔ ∃ k : ℤ, k • P = F P) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [Algebra (ZMod 5) K] [CharP K 5] (a : K) (ha : a ^ 2 = 2), (3 : ℕ) • (rationalPoint : (baseCurve.baseChange K).Point) = 0 ∧ (3 : ℕ) • antiPoint a ha = 0 ∧ pointFrobenius baseCurve (rationalPoint : (baseCurve.baseChange K).Point) = rationalPoint ∧ pointFrobenius baseCurve (antiPoint a ha) = -antiPoint a ha ∧ addOrderOf (mixedPoint a ha) = 3 ∧ pointFrobenius baseCurve (mixedPoint a ha) ∉ AddSubgroup.zmultiples (mixedPoint a ha)) ∧ (Fintype.card F25 = 25 ∧ Module.finrank (ZMod 5) F25 = 2 ∧ (baseCurve.baseChange F25).Δ ≠ 0 ∧ ∃ P : (baseCurve.baseChange F25).Point, addOrderOf P = 3 ∧ pointFrobenius baseCurve P ∉ AddSubgroup.zmultiples P ∧ (¬∃ k : ℤ, k • P = pointFrobenius baseCurve P) ∧ (¬∃ Q : baseCurve.Point, rationalInclusion F25 Q = P)) ∧ (¬∀ P : (baseCurve.baseChange F25).Point, baseCurve.Δ ≠ 0 → addOrderOf P = 3 → ∃ k : ℤ, k • P = pointFrobenius baseCurve P) ∧ (∃ B : (baseCurve.baseChange F25).Point, addOrderOf B = 3 ∧ pointFrobenius baseCurve B = -B ∧ (∀ Q ∈ AddSubgroup.zmultiples B, pointFrobenius baseCurve Q ∈ AddSubgroup.zmultiples B) ∧ (¬∃ Q : baseCurve.Point, rationalInclusion F25 Q = B))",
    "decl_sha256": "762ed418a4d3a6fe07f37b73f9066c427aa5cf722f3dcfd0c30666e955335fa7",
    "scope": "Actual elliptic Frobenius qualification in the square-rootVelu irrational-generator discussion, published2020section4.14/printed49. For actual nonsingular E/F5:y²=x³+1 and actual K=GaloisField5,2 with cardinality25/extensiondegree2, constructa²2, actual A=(0,1) fixedcoordinateFrobenius andB=(1,a) antifixed, both actual3torsion. Actual P=A+B has exactorder3, is nonrational overF5 and its actualq=5Frobenius image liesoutsideactualcyclicsubgroup, hence nointegerscalar λ exists. Directnegation of the literal arbitraryirrational-point scalar assertion retains actualnonsingularcurve/prime3/copimechar5/finitequadraticextension domains. Generic actualadditive-subgroupstability iff existenceofintegerscalar on generator proved, and actualirrationalB exactorder3/nonrational/stablecyclic/FrobB=−B positivecontrol shows nonrationalgenerator neednotfail. ActualMathlibPoint group/coordinatefieldmap/3divisionquartic and actualGaloisField roots supply everybridge; no matrix-onlymodel or torsion/Frob conclusion premise. The publishedparagraph may intend an implicitlyrationalcyclickernel fromisogenycontext; that strongercontext is retained, notrefuted. MainTheorem4.11 rational-generator operationcount remainsunrefuted/notfullyLeanverified; arbitraryrational-kernel inputencoding/cost notverified. No canonicalisogeny/kernelGaloisdescent/fullruntime/Crefinement or ambiguous minimalxdegree/eigenvalueorderclaim. FullarXivv1 22pageprose read, publishedselectedTheorem4.11/Algorithm2/4.14 printed47–49/PDF10–12 textread/11–12visual, notfullpublisher20page read. Known cyclicFrobqualification credited, no noveltyclaim/canonicalcorpuspromotion. Priorproof/artifact/claim bytes unchanged. Standardfoundations/defaults/no holes/customaxioms/nativeproofeval/limits/newglobalflags/waivers/newcryptoexperiment/spend/upload. Nativewrittenheader parsing/hash procedural, not kernel parser/hash/physicalhostrefinement.",
